        "title": "Kanan ramthan njuan khang tei",
        "credits": {
          "translator": null,
          "editor": null
        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Kanan ramthan njuan khang 3)_,",
            "Jingpui bam khou gin ne;",
            "Kagan rina achang man the,",
            "Mai le muang rui gan guang o,",
            "Ahu khou hei guanga gan no.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "He kanloumei pu bui nung hou nicho?",
            "Kanan ram tang mak khang lunggei;",
            "Rianra jingmei muang dingkhou,",
            "Achun sihna kapma huai e.",
            "",
            "2. Nuan phungmei kandih mei nun khang,",
            "Ringmei dui than patdiu;",
            "Kaniu nuan 3)_ khiu than lana,",
            "Kanloumei pu ta hou khang,",
            "Hei kandih ta ning dat mak khang.",
            "",
            "3. Ahu khou ching khat gut kan the,",
            "Kanan ram gai khou 3)_;",
            "Rianra puiram ning dat lakkhe,",
            "Thei pui bam tuan pukhou rui,",
            "Ringpui namdai 3)_ njuan ni.",
            "",
            "4. Tingkau ganphiu gan pui ram khou,",
            "Kanloumei pu thuan ni;",
            "Kandih rianra man lou puni,",
            "Neila pui lu than suan ni,",
            "Khou 3)_ bam khang ai neila e."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
